the Saveable is a contract.
this allows Saved.
this allows Booming.

the Tiny is a contract.
this allows ok.

the Game is an actor.
this can Inner.
this's Inner does...
    that is Saveable.
    if input exists?
        this is Saved!
    or?
        this is Booming!

this can Outer.
this's Outer does...
    that is Tiny.
    do this's Inner...
        when that is Saved?
            this is ok!
        or?
            this is ok!

the App is a script.
do Game's Outer with "x".
log "ok".
